%% Notification path: detection to a human, with debounce so a flickering
%% detector does not send 400 emails. Target end-to-end p95 < 5 s.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Edge device
    participant C as IoT Core (MQTT)
    participant R as IoT Rule
    participant L as Lambda handler
    participant Q as Debounce / dedupe (near-dup, config rules)
    participant N as SNS / SES
    participant H as Human (operator)

    D->>C: publish detection_event (QoS 1)
    C->>R: match event topic
    R->>L: invoke with event
    L->>Q: same incident within window? user opted in?
    alt suppressed (near-duplicate or quiet hours)
        Q-->>L: drop / aggregate
    else deliver
        Q-->>L: pass
        L->>N: push + email
        N->>H: alert (target < 5 s from detection)
    end
    Note over D,H: Fire (life-safety) also has a LOCAL alarm at the edge,<br/>< 1 s, independent of the WAN.
